#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:1
msgid "Persistence, Outputs, and Data I/O"
msgstr "持久化、输出与 Data I/O"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:3
msgid "RELIC provides three distinct persistence layers:"
msgstr "RELIC提供了三层持久性："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:5
msgid "`StateManager` snapshots for in-memory transactional restore."
msgstr "`StateManager`快照用于内存事务恢复。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:6
msgid "`RELICSimulator` checkpoints for runtime continuation."
msgstr "`RELICSimulator`阶段检查点用于runtime继续。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:7
msgid "Data and provenance writers for durable scientific outputs."
msgstr "数据和provenance写作者为持久科学输出。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:9
msgid "These layers serve different contracts and are not interchangeable."
msgstr "这些层有不同的契约，不能互换使用。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:11
msgid "State snapshots"
msgstr "状态推进快照"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:13
msgid "`StateManager.checkpoint()` returns an in-memory mapping containing state tensors, counters, diagnostics, history, conservation records, and pending provenance transaction data. `restore(snapshot)` accepts only a valid mapping produced by that state manager contract."
msgstr "`StateManager.checkpoint()`返回一个包含状态张量、计数器、diagnostics、历史记录、守恒记录和待处理起源事务数据的内存映射。`restore(snapshot)`仅接受由该状态管理合约生成的有效映射。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:46
msgid "Expected output:"
msgstr "预期输出："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:52
msgid "`restore()` raises `TypeError` for a non-mapping snapshot and `ValueError` when the required state mapping is absent. Use snapshots around local transactions; they are not a stable cross-version file format."
msgstr "`restore()` raises `TypeError` for a non-mapping snapshot and `ValueError` when the required state mapping is absent. Use snapshots around local transactions； they are not a stable cross-version file format."

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:56
msgid "Simulator checkpoints"
msgstr "Simulator断点"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:73
msgid "`relic\\core\\simulator\\checkpoint.py` is the sole owner of the durable checkpoint format. Without `snapshot`, the public create call captures the live state and requires an explicit, non-existing target path; an existing file raises `FileExistsError`. It creates parent directories, writes a unique sibling temporary file, and atomically commits the target. `snapshot` is a frozen checkpoint payload captured at an accepted step boundary for a checkpoint delivery: it is written as given and never rebuilt from live state, and an existing target is accepted only when its verified payload is identical, in which case the receipt is returned again; a different file raises `FileExistsError`. The call never selects an implicit output directory and never overwrites an existing checkpoint."
msgstr "`relic\\core\\simulator\\checkpoint.py` 是持久检查点格式的唯一所有者。未提供 `snapshot` 时，公开创建调用捕获当前状态，要求显式给出尚不存在的目标路径；目标文件已存在则抛出 `FileExistsError`。它会创建父目录，写入唯一命名的同级临时文件，再原子提交目标。`snapshot` 是在已接受时间步边界为检查点交付捕获的冻结载荷：按原样写入，绝不根据当前状态重建。只有已有目标经验证与该载荷相同时才会接受，并再次返回回执；文件内容不同则抛出 `FileExistsError`。该调用不选择隐式输出目录，也不覆盖已有检查点。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:143
msgid "Both operations return `path`, `format_version`, `size_bytes`, file `sha256`, canonical `payload_sha256`, and `provider_epoch`. Creation leaves `provider_epoch=None`; a successful restore reports the newly committed view epoch. Automatic checkpoint names are `checkpoint_directory/<run_id>/checkpoint_step_<12-digit-step>.pt`. `run_id` belongs to the simulator, survives restart, and changes on reset."
msgstr "两个操作都返回 `path`、`format_version`、`size_bytes`、文件 `sha256`、canonical `payload_sha256` 和 `provider_epoch`。创建时 `provider_epoch=None`；成功恢复则报告新提交视图的 epoch。自动检查点的名称为 `checkpoint_directory/<run_id>/checkpoint_step_<12-digit-step>.pt`。`run_id` 属于 simulator，在重启后保留，并在 reset 时改变。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:150
msgid "Format 3 includes the frozen `delivery_state`: accepted pending obligations, receipts, job definitions, and flat checkpoint-node references. Restoring a checkpoint reconciles accepted notifications and delivery work through the existing owners; it does not recapture newer live outputs or deliver effects during state restoration. Retry retains each original run and destination. Delivery is at-least-once: every obligation carries an idempotency key and a receipt, so redelivery to an idempotent consumer is effectively-once. Cross-system exactly-once delivery requires the counterpart to take part in the protocol and is not claimed. Only obligations present in the persisted checkpoint are durably recoverable."
msgstr "格式 3 包含冻结的 `delivery_state`：已接受但尚待履行的义务、回执、作业定义和平铺的检查点节点引用。恢复检查点时，通过现有所有者协调已接受的通知与交付工作；不会重新捕获更新后的运行时输出，也不会在状态恢复过程中执行外部效果。重试保留每项工作的原始运行身份和目的地。交付语义为至少一次：每项义务均带有幂等键和回执，因此对幂等消费者的重复交付具有实际一次的效果。跨系统的恰好一次交付需要对端参与协议，本系统不作此声明。只有已写入持久检查点的义务才能在持久恢复中找回。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:161
msgid "The versioned `relic.simulator.checkpoint` payload contains:"
msgstr "版本化的 `relic.simulator.checkpoint` payload 包含："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:163
msgid "simulator time, counters, configuration-relevant runtime fields, and output history;"
msgstr "simulator 时间、计数器、与配置相关的 runtime 字段以及输出历史；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:165
msgid "one validated in-memory `StateManager.checkpoint()` snapshot;"
msgstr "一个经过验证的内存内 `StateManager.checkpoint()` snapshot；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:166
#, python-brace-format
msgid "every registered Functor's `{state_dict, parameter_bindings}` entry: standard PyTorch module state (including safe `get_extra_state()` data) and live values of manager bindings held by reference, including nested Functors;"
msgstr "每个已注册 Functor 的 `{state_dict, parameter_bindings}` 条目：标准 PyTorch 模块状态（包括安全的 `get_extra_state()` 数据），以及按引用持有的管理器绑定的当前值，包含嵌套 Functor；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:169
msgid "Functor topology, dependency order/groups, StateManager schema, scientific configuration/metadata/parameter contracts, resolved devices, and distributed rank/world-size signature;"
msgstr "Functor 拓扑、依赖顺序/分组、StateManager schema、科学配置/metadata/参数 contract、已解析的 device，以及 distributed rank/world-size 签名；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:172
msgid "Python, Torch CPU, optional legacy global NumPy, and CUDA random number generator (RNG) states;"
msgstr "Python、Torch CPU、可选旧版全局 NumPy 以及 CUDA 的随机数生成器（Random Number Generator, RNG）状态；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:173
msgid "a canonical payload Secure Hash Algorithm 256-bit (SHA-256) integrity record."
msgstr "规范载荷的 256 位安全散列算法（Secure Hash Algorithm 256-bit, SHA-256）完整性校验记录。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:175
msgid "Restore uses `torch.load(..., map_location=\"cpu\", weights_only=True)`, requires the exact `relic.simulator.checkpoint` format and `format_version=3`, and has no unsafe deserialization fallback. Only version 3 is written. A version-2 file is upgraded in memory: held bindings move from module state into `parameter_bindings`; an unknown state entry raises `ValueError`. The upgraded payload is resealed and validated, and `format_upgrade` in the restore receipt records `from_format_version`, `to_format_version`, and `moved_bindings`. Binding restore requires matching key sets, shape, and dtype and preserves the live object, gradient flag, and device. CUDA RNG presence must match the resolved runtime symmetrically, including the CUDA device count; when pinning `RELICSimulator` to `\"device\": \"cpu\"` on a CUDA-capable host, pass `device=torch.device(\"cpu\")` to an externally constructed `StateManager` so both owners resolve CPU tensors symmetrically. The current single-file format fails closed on both create and restore when an active distributed runtime has `world_size > 1`."
msgstr "恢复操作调用 `torch.load(..., map_location=\"cpu\", weights_only=True)`，严格要求 `relic.simulator.checkpoint` 格式标识与 `format_version=3`，不设非安全反序列化回退路径。写出操作仅生成版本 3 格式。读取版本 2 检查点时会在内存中执行升级：按引用持有的参数绑定从模块状态迁移至 `parameter_bindings`，遇到未知状态条目则抛出 `ValueError`；升级后的载荷将重新计算完整性摘要并完成校验，恢复回执中的 `format_upgrade` 字段记录 `from_format_version`、`to_format_version` 与 `moved_bindings`。参数绑定恢复要求键集合、张量形状与数据类型严格一致，并保留在线张量对象、梯度标志与所属设备。检查点中 CUDA RNG 状态的存在性及 CUDA 设备数量必须与当前解析出的运行时环境双向对称匹配；在具备 CUDA 的宿主机上将 `RELICSimulator` 固定为 `\"device\": \"cpu\"` 时，若从外部构造 `StateManager`，需同步传入 `device=torch.device(\"cpu\")` 以确保两处所有者对称解析为 CPU 张量。当活动分布式运行时的 `world_size > 1` 时，当前单文件检查点格式在创建与恢复阶段均执行封闭拒绝。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:191
msgid "Restore requires a prepared, compatible simulator. It validates payload integrity, topology, scientific contracts, devices, distributed context, StateManager state, Functor state dictionaries, and RNG data before applying the restart. A failure before provider-view publication restores the pre-restore runtime fields, StateManager, Functor state, RNG, accepted pending work, and registration metadata. Once the new provider view is published, its epoch and scientific state remain committed even if retirement, cleanup, or receipt I/O fails; that error is reported as post-publication failure and must not rewind a world that readers may already have observed."
msgstr "恢复要求一个已准备好且兼容的 simulator。在应用重启之前，它会验证 payload 完整性、拓扑、科学 contract、device、distributed context、StateManager 状态、Functor state dictionary 以及 RNG 数据。在 provider 视图发布之前发生的失败会恢复恢复前的 runtime 字段、StateManager、Functor 状态、RNG、已接受的待处理工作以及注册 metadata。一旦新的 provider 视图发布，即使退役、清理或回执 I/O 失败，其 epoch 与科学状态仍保持已提交；该错误作为发布后失败报告，且不得回退读者可能已经观察到的世界。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:201
msgid "A checkpoint does not capture the state of external services or data sources. An external adapter stores only its source and model binding (`get_extra_state()`), and restoring that binding into an adapter bound to another source or model raises `ValueError`. Its opened datasets are not part of the checkpoint; a restarted run opens them again through `discover()` and `open()`. Adapter `forward(state, time, dt, *, calendar_type, time_origin)` selects forcing at `time_origin + time` using its declared `time_interpolation`; it does not own a separate mutable time cursor. An explicitly bound forcing sequence has the simulator-owned cursor, which advances only on accepted steps and is restored by the checkpoint."
msgstr "检查点不捕获外部服务或数据源的状态。外部适配器只保存其数据源和模型绑定（`get_extra_state()`）；将该绑定恢复到另一个数据源或模型的适配器时，会抛出 `ValueError`。已打开的数据集不属于检查点；重启运行通过 `discover()` 和 `open()` 重新打开它们。适配器的 `forward(state, time, dt, *, calendar_type, time_origin)` 按声明的 `time_interpolation` 选择 `time_origin + time` 时刻的强迫，不持有另一个可变时间游标。显式绑定的强迫序列使用模拟器持有的游标，仅在时间步接受后推进，并由检查点恢复。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:212
msgid "The default restore is exact. The same owner accepts a `RestartCompatibilityCertificate` for bounded declared contract/parameter differences and state renames that preserve units, shape, and dtype. It binds the actual source and target topology digests; it cannot waive kernel, implementation, Functor-type, execution-order, or runtime-environment changes. Its forcing policy either preserves the exact cursor or explicitly clears it. `GraphMigrationCertificate` handles declared renaming/addition/retirement in its restricted graph family, including history requirements and mapped owners. The two certificate arguments are mutually exclusive. Neither provides arbitrary code equivalence, unit conversion, or shape migration."
msgstr "默认恢复是精确恢复。同一 owner 接受 `RestartCompatibilityCertificate`，用于有界的已声明 contract/参数差异以及保持单位、shape 和 dtype 的状态重命名。它绑定实际的源与目标拓扑摘要；它不能豁免 kernel、实现、Functor 类型、执行顺序或 runtime 环境的变化。其 forcing 策略要么保留精确的 cursor，要么显式清除它。`GraphMigrationCertificate` 处理其受限 graph 族中已声明的重命名/添加/退役，包括历史要求与映射后的 owner。这两个证书参数互斥。二者都不提供任意代码等价、单位转换或 shape 迁移。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:223
msgid "`StateManager.checkpoint()` remains an in-memory transaction primitive. It is embedded in the durable simulator payload but is not an independent file format or a second persistence owner. Likewise, Functors use `state_dict()`/`load_state_dict()` and PyTorch `get_extra_state()`/`set_extra_state()` without introducing a parallel restart API. Stochastic Functors built on `FunctorSubstreamMixin`, including `OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor` (`relic.scientific.atmosphere.stochastic_temperature`) and `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor` (`relic.scientific.atmosphere.stochastic_rainfall`), persist their Wiener or marked-jump substream cursor in `extra_state`, so accepted-step rollback and `restore_checkpoint()` replay the identical stochastic sample path. Manager bindings held by reference are outside module state; the same checkpoint owner captures and restores them through `parameter_bindings`."
msgstr "`StateManager.checkpoint()` 仅作为内存级事务原语使用，其快照数据嵌入在模拟器的持久化载荷内部，不构成独立文件格式，也不充当第二持久化所有者。同理，各 Functor 直接复用 `state_dict()`/`load_state_dict()` 与 PyTorch 的 `get_extra_state()`/`set_extra_state()` 接口，不另建平行的重启 API。基于 `FunctorSubstreamMixin` 构建的随机过程 Functor——包括 `OrnsteinUhlenbeckTemperatureFunctor`（`relic.scientific.atmosphere.stochastic_temperature`）与 `MarkedPoissonRainfallFunctor`（`relic.scientific.atmosphere.stochastic_rainfall`）——将其维纳过程（Wiener）或标记跳跃子流游标持久化在 `extra_state` 中，从而使已接受步回滚与 `restore_checkpoint()` 精确重放同一条随机样本轨道。按引用持有的参数管理器绑定位于模块状态字典之外，由同一检查点所有者通过 `parameter_bindings` 统一捕获并恢复。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:237
msgid "Automatic checkpoints are disabled by default. Enabling them requires all three runtime settings:"
msgstr "自动检查点默认禁用。启用它们需要以下全部三个 runtime 设置："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:257
msgid "The frequency must be positive. Automatic persistence occurs only after an accepted scientific and provenance step commit, using `checkpoint_step_<12-digit-step>.pt` in the explicit directory's `run_id` subdirectory. File errors propagate, and there is no public checkpoint cleanup API."
msgstr "频率必须为正。自动持久化仅在科学与 provenance step 提交被接受之后发生，使用显式目录下 `run_id` 子目录中的 `checkpoint_step_<12-digit-step>.pt`。文件错误会向上传播，且没有公开的检查点清理 API。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:263
msgid "A bitwise-equal uninterrupted run and split restart run is strong dynamic evidence only for the tested graph, inputs, fixed-step protocol, dependency stack, and device environment. It does not promise cross-platform, cross-version, cross-device, or multi-rank bitwise identity."
msgstr "不间断运行与拆分重启运行之间的逐位相等，仅对所测试的 graph、输入、固定步长协议、依赖栈和 device 环境构成强动态证据。它不承诺跨平台、跨版本、跨 device 或多 rank 的逐位一致。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:268
msgid "Run bundles"
msgstr "运行捆綁"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:305
msgid "`write_run_bundle` is imported from `relic.orchestration.compiler`; the `relic.orchestration` package does not export it. `graph` must be the canonical `GraphIR` that `plan` was compiled from; another type raises `TypeError` and a different graph raises `ValueError`. `run_id` names the provenance run (default: the current UTC time, `YYYYMMDDTHHMMSSZ`). `input_files` lists the input files to hash; when it is omitted, `graph.metadata[\"input_files\"]` is used. `metadata` adds caller entries to the bundle metadata; the keys `schema_version` and `graph_metadata` are reserved and raise `ValueError`."
msgstr "`write_run_bundle` 从 `relic.orchestration.compiler` 导入；`relic.orchestration` 包不导出它。`graph` 必须是编译 `plan` 所用的规范 `GraphIR`；类型不同会抛出 `TypeError`，图不同会抛出 `ValueError`。`run_id` 指定溯源运行名称（默认采用当前 UTC 时间，`YYYYMMDDTHHMMSSZ`）。`input_files` 列出要计算哈希的输入文件；省略时使用 `graph.metadata[\"input_files\"]`。`metadata` 向证据包元数据加入调用方条目；`schema_version` 和 `graph_metadata` 是保留键，使用时会抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:315
msgid "The bundle records the declarative workflow, compile result, runtime log target, environment and repository evidence, input checksums when input files are declared, and W3C Provenance Data Model (PROV) metadata."
msgstr "溯源包记录声明式工作流定义、图编译结果、运行时日志目标、运行环境与代码仓库证据、已声明输入文件的校验和，以及 W3C 溯源数据模型（W3C Provenance Data Model, PROV）元数据。"

