#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:394
msgid "The writer converts conservation summaries to an xarray dataset and delegates Climate and Forecast (CF) attribute synchronization and output creation to `DataWriter`, without adding time bounds. It returns the `WriteResult` and raises `OSError` when the write or its output validation fails. `metadata_registry` replaces the default per-variable diagnostic metadata. `delivery_key` is stored as the global attribute `relic_delivery_key`, so a retried delivery with the same key and options keeps the original creation timestamp. `summaries` and `time_coords` must describe the same sequence of simulation steps."
msgstr "该写出器将守恒诊断摘要转换为 xarray 数据集，并将气候与预报（Climate and Forecast, CF）属性同步及文件落盘委托给 `DataWriter`，期间不附加时间边界变量。写出成功时返回 `WriteResult`，写出失败或输出校验未通过时抛出 `OSError`。`metadata_registry` 可替换默认的逐变量诊断元数据。`delivery_key` 作为全局属性 `relic_delivery_key` 持久化，确保使用相同交付键与配置重试写出时保留原始创建时间戳。`summaries` 与 `time_coords` 必须对应同一模拟步序列。"

