#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "File metadata mapping; a file whose metadata cannot be read raises (no mapping carrying an `error` entry)."
msgstr "文件元数据映射；无法读取元数据时直接报错，不返回含 `error` 条目的映射。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:589
msgid "`ReadResult` retains loaded data, metadata, CF and validation flags, warnings, timing, file size, time-processing status, and standardized-variable mappings. `WriteResult` reports the output path, size, timing, compression ratio, CF and validation flags, warnings, variables, coordinates, and computed bounds."
msgstr "`ReadResult` 保留已加载的 data、metadata、CF 与 validation flag、warning、timing、file size、time-processing status 以及 standardized-variable mapping。`WriteResult` 报告 output path、size、timing、compression ratio、CF 与 validation flag、warning、variable、coordinate 以及计算得到的 bound。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:594
msgid "Interpret every CF result by its declared scope. The existing `CFConventions.validate_cf_compliance(...)` checks one variable's official standard name and compatible units; it reports `single_variable_standard_name_and_units`, not whole-dataset conformance. `CFConventions.validate_dataset_conformance(...)` evaluates `declared_dataset_scope`: the Conventions declaration, units, official names, axis values, time units/calendar, coordinates and bounds references/shapes, missing-value consistency, and cell-method syntax/dimensions. Grid mappings, discrete sampling geometries, gathering compression, external variables, and group hierarchies are outside that scope. Name Table v94 membership cannot itself authorize a dataset Conventions declaration."
msgstr "请按其声明范围解读每个 CF 结果。现有的 `CFConventions.validate_cf_compliance(...)` 检查单个变量的官方 standard name 与兼容单位；它报告的是 `single_variable_standard_name_and_units`，而非整个数据集的合规。`CFConventions.validate_dataset_conformance(...)` 评估 `declared_dataset_scope`：Conventions 声明、单位、官方名称、axis 取值、时间单位/calendar、coordinate 与 bounds 的引用/shape、缺失值一致性，以及 cell-method 语法/dimension。Grid mapping、离散采样几何、gathering 压缩、外部变量以及 group 层级都不在该范围内。Name Table v94 成员身份本身不能授权数据集的 Conventions 声明。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:606
msgid "The external `IOHandler.read(...)` reports its dataset check through `IOResult.cf_validation_scope`, `dataset_conformance_checked`, and `cf_conformance_issues`; `cf_compliant=True` requires that the declared check actually ran and found no issue. Other result types and unchecked paths must not inherit this claim merely from a similarly named boolean field."
msgstr "外部的 `IOHandler.read(...)` 通过 `IOResult.cf_validation_scope`、`dataset_conformance_checked` 和 `cf_conformance_issues` 报告其数据集检查；`cf_compliant=True` 要求所声明的检查实际运行且未发现问题。其他 result 类型和未经检查的路径不得仅因一个名称相似的布尔字段而继承该声明。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:612
msgid "Supported read formats include NetCDF4, NetCDF3, HDF5, Zarr, and CSV. Supported write formats include NetCDF4, NetCDF3, Zarr, and CSV. A missing file raises `FileNotFoundError`; unsupported data or formats raise `ValueError`; strict CF violations raise `ValueError`."
msgstr "支持的读取格式包括NetCDF4，NetCDF3，HDF5，Zarr和CSV。支持的写入格式包括NetCDF4，NetCDF3，Zarr和CSV。缺失文件引发`FileNotFoundError`；不支持的数据或格式引发`ValueError`；严格的CF违规引发`ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:617
msgid "For conversion overrides, prefix reader-only options with `read_`:"
msgstr "对于转换覆盖，将只读选项前缀为`read_`:"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:663
msgid "Experimental data quality and streaming gates"
msgstr "实验性数据质量与流式处理门禁"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:665
msgid "Two experimental data modules remain gated by explicit environment variables checked at import time:"
msgstr "两个实验性数据模块受导入阶段检查的显式环境变量门禁保护："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:668
msgid "`relic.data.quality` (`QualityValidator`, `RangeRule`, `ValidationIssue`) requires `RELIC_EXPERIMENTAL_DATA_QUALITY=1` before import; otherwise `require_experimental_feature` raises `RuntimeError`."
msgstr "`relic.data.quality`（包含 `QualityValidator`、`RangeRule`、`ValidationIssue`）要求在导入前设置 `RELIC_EXPERIMENTAL_DATA_QUALITY=1`，未设置时 `require_experimental_feature` 直接抛出 `RuntimeError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:671
msgid "`relic.data.streaming` requires `RELIC_EXPERIMENTAL_STREAMING=1` before import; otherwise the exported names raise `StreamingDisabledError` (or `RuntimeError`)."
msgstr "`relic.data.streaming` 要求在导入前设置 `RELIC_EXPERIMENTAL_STREAMING=1`，未设置时访问其导出符号会抛出 `StreamingDisabledError`（或 `RuntimeError`）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:675
msgid "Streaming windows"
msgstr "流式窗口"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "`size`"
msgstr "`size`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Window length; a window is complete when the newest record is at least `size` after the window start. The reduced output is stamped at the window centre."
msgstr "窗口长度；最新记录至少位于窗口起点之后 `size` 时，窗口才完整。归约输出的时间戳位于窗口中心。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "`step`"
msgstr "`step`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Advance of the window start; `None` uses `size`."
msgstr "窗口起点的推进量；`None` 使用 `size`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "`aggregation_method`"
msgstr "`aggregation_method`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Reduction over time: `mean`, `sum`, `min`, or `max`, written as `cell_methods = \"time: <method>\"`. Any other value, including `\"MEAN\"`, raises `ValueError` when the window is built."
msgstr "时间归约方式：`mean`、`sum`、`min` 或 `max`，以 `cell_methods = \"time: <method>\"` 指定。任何其他值（包括 `\"MEAN\"`）都会在构建窗口时引发 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "`quality_checks`"
msgstr "`quality_checks`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Run quality control on each window."
msgstr "对每个窗口执行质量控制。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:693
msgid "The window has no coverage or gap fields; passing `min_data_fraction` or `max_gap_duration` raises `TypeError`. Coverage and gap limits come from the quality-control parameters `coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold` and `coupling.scales.temporal.quality_control.*`."
msgstr "窗口没有覆盖率或缺口字段；传入 `min_data_fraction` 或 `max_gap_duration` 会抛出 `TypeError`。覆盖率与缺口限制来自质量控制参数 `coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold` 和 `coupling.scales.temporal.quality_control.*`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:698
msgid "With `quality_checks=True`, the window time series of each variable is checked before the reduction with `QualityController.validate_for_operation(series, time_coord, \"aggregation\")`. A series fails when its valid fraction is below the coverage threshold or its quality grade is below `acceptable`; the reduced variable then gets the attribute `quality_flags = \"validation_failed\"`. A variable without a time dimension gets `\"not_assessed\"`. A numeric time axis needs CF `units` and `calendar` attributes, and window data without a `time` dimension raises. Errors propagate to the stream consumer; a failed window is not dropped with a warning."
msgstr "启用 `quality_checks=True` 时，在归约前使用 `QualityController.validate_for_operation(series, time_coord, \"aggregation\")` 检查每个变量的窗口时间序列。有效比例低于覆盖率阈值，或质量等级低于 `acceptable` 时，该序列失败；归约后的变量会获得属性 `quality_flags = \"validation_failed\"`。没有时间维的变量获得 `\"not_assessed\"`。数值时间轴需要 CF 的 `units` 和 `calendar` 属性；窗口数据没有 `time` 维时会报错。错误传递给流消费者，不会仅记录警告后丢弃失败窗口。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:709
msgid "CF attributes after scaling"
msgstr "尺度转换后的 CF 属性"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:711
msgid "`CFAttributeSynchronizer` in `relic.data.standards.cf_conventions` carries explicit CF metadata through a processing step. It does not change or unit-convert the data tensor, and it does not infer units, variable roles, grids, or coordinates. Each `sync_after_*` method passes the data and metadata through `CFConventions.sync_variable_attributes`, which derives two metadata values from the data: `shape` (`list(data.shape)`) and, for non-empty data, `actual_range` (`[float(data.min()), float(data.max())]`). The range is `[nan, nan]` when the data contain NaN. For empty data `actual_range` is not written, so a value already in the input metadata is kept. The method-specific attributes in the table below are written on top of these two fields."
msgstr "`relic.data.standards.cf_conventions` 中的 `CFAttributeSynchronizer` 在处理步骤中传递显式 CF 元数据。它不改变数据张量或转换其单位，也不推断单位、变量角色、网格或坐标。每个 `sync_after_*` 方法都通过 `CFConventions.sync_variable_attributes` 传递数据与元数据；后者从数据导出两个元数据值：`shape`（`list(data.shape)`），以及非空数据的 `actual_range`（`[float(data.min()), float(data.max())]`）。数据含 NaN 时，范围为 `[nan, nan]`。空数据不写入 `actual_range`，因此保留输入元数据中已有的值。下表的方法专属属性写在这两个字段之上。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:723
msgid "`sync_variable_attributes` first checks the standard name and units of the input metadata and raises `ValueError` for an issue even when `strict_mode` is `False`; the only exception is when every issue is an undefined unit contract for the standard name. With `strict_mode=True`, the updated metadata is checked again, and an issue found by this bounded CF check raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "`sync_variable_attributes` 首先检查输入元数据的标准名称和单位；即使 `strict_mode` 为 `False`，有问题时也会抛出 `ValueError`。唯一例外是所有问题都属于该标准名称的单位契约未定义。启用 `strict_mode=True` 时，会再次检查更新后的元数据；这一有限范围的 CF 检查发现问题时，抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "行为"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "`sync_after_aggregation(data, metadata, aggregation_method, dimension=\"time\", *, source_label, target_label)`"
msgstr "`sync_after_aggregation(data, metadata, aggregation_method, dimension=\"time\", *, source_label, target_label)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Sets the `<dimension>: <method>` cell method and appends `Aggregated <dimension> from <source_label> to <target_label> (<dimension>: <method>)` to `history`."
msgstr "设置 `<dimension>: <method>` 单元方法，并向 `history` 追加 `Aggregated <dimension> from <source_label> to <target_label> (<dimension>: <method>)`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "`sync_after_disaggregation(data, metadata, disaggregation_method, dimension=\"area\", *, source_label, target_label)`"
msgstr "`sync_after_disaggregation(data, metadata, disaggregation_method, dimension=\"area\", *, source_label, target_label)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Same, with a `Disaggregated ...` entry. The allowed cell methods depend on `dimension`: `sum` (each fine cell holds its own total) or `mean` (each fine cell holds a mean) for `area`, and `sum`, `mean`, or `point` (instantaneous states) for `time`. Other methods and other dimensions raise `ValueError`."
msgstr "行为相同，但采用 `Disaggregated ...` 条目。允许的单元方法取决于 `dimension`：`area` 允许 `sum`（每个细单元保存自身总量）或 `mean`（每个细单元保存均值）；`time` 允许 `sum`、`mean` 或 `point`（瞬时状态）。其他方法和其他维度均抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "`sync_after_regridding(data, metadata, regrid_method, source_grid, target_grid)`"
msgstr "`sync_after_regridding(data, metadata, regrid_method, source_grid, target_grid)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Requires `shape` in both grids and a non-empty string for each name in `CF_REGRID_TARGET_GRID_FIELDS` (`grid_mapping`, `lat_name`, `lon_name`) in `target_grid`; writes `grid_mapping` and `coordinates` and appends a regridding entry to `history`."
msgstr "要求两个网格都包含 `shape`，并且 `target_grid` 中 `CF_REGRID_TARGET_GRID_FIELDS` 列出的各名称（`grid_mapping`、`lat_name`、`lon_name`）都对应非空字符串；写入 `grid_mapping` 和 `coordinates`，并向 `history` 追加重网格化记录。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "`sync_after_temporal_aggregation(data, metadata, time_coord, operation, method, coverage_stats, *, source_label, target_label)`"
msgstr "`sync_after_temporal_aggregation(data, metadata, time_coord, operation, method, coverage_stats, *, source_label, target_label)`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md
msgid "Calls `sync_after_aggregation` (`operation=\"aggregation\"`) or `sync_after_disaggregation` (`operation=\"disaggregation\"`) with `dimension=\"time\"`. The variable keeps its `standard_name`, `units`, and `long_name`, gets the `time: <method>` cell method, and gains the history entry `Aggregated time from <source_label> to <target_label> (time: <method>)` (or `Disaggregated time ...`). Coverage fields come from the required `coverage_stats` (`coverage_fraction`, or `valid_points` and `total_points`): `coverage_fraction`, `coverage_threshold` read from `coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold`, and `quality_state` (`good_data` or `insufficient_coverage`). The attributes of the result time coordinate are returned under `time_coordinate`, with `bounds` only when the coordinate has bounds; in strict mode only these time-coordinate attributes get the temporal check."
msgstr "使用 `dimension=\"time\"` 调用 `sync_after_aggregation`（`operation=\"aggregation\"`）或 `sync_after_disaggregation`（`operation=\"disaggregation\"`）。变量保留 `standard_name`、`units` 和 `long_name`，获得 `time: <method>` 单元方法，并增加历史条目 `Aggregated time from <source_label> to <target_label> (time: <method>)`（或 `Disaggregated time ...`）。覆盖率字段来自必需的 `coverage_stats`（`coverage_fraction`，或 `valid_points` 和 `total_points`）：`coverage_fraction`、从 `coupling.scales.temporal.coverage_threshold` 读取的 `coverage_threshold`，以及 `quality_state`（`good_data` 或 `insufficient_coverage`）。结果时间坐标的属性返回在 `time_coordinate` 中，仅当坐标带有边界时才包含 `bounds`；严格模式下仅对这些时间坐标属性执行时间检查。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:737
msgid "The source and target labels are required, non-empty scale labels such as `\"hourly\"` and `\"daily\"`; a missing or empty label raises."
msgstr "源标签和目标标签必须提供，且为非空尺度标签，例如 `\"hourly\"` 和 `\"daily\"`；标签缺失或为空会报错。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:740
msgid "Data I/O command checks"
msgstr "数据I/O命令检查"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:748
msgid "Use `--help` on the selected subcommand before an operation because format-specific arguments are command-specific."
msgstr "在选择子命令前使用`--help`因为特定格式的参数是命令特定的。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/workflows/persistence_outputs_and_data_io.md:751
msgid "`data io check` runs the I/O health checks. The I/O performance check is an error when its read or write benchmark fails (a failed memory benchmark lowers a healthy result to a warning); the streaming throughput check of the experimental `data stream check` is an error when a benchmark raises."
msgstr "`data io check` 执行 I/O 健康检查。I/O 性能检查中的读取或写入基准失败时，结果为错误（内存基准失败会将健康结果降为警告）；实验性 `data stream check` 的流式吞吐检查在基准抛出异常时结果为错误。"

